# SITL env bundle: default (no PX4_PARAM_* overrides beyond airframe + image patches).
#
# Selected by SITL_PARAM_PROFILE in the top-level .env (compose interpolation).
# Variables here are injected into the isaac-sim container and applied at PX4 boot
# via PX4_PARAM_* → param set in ROMFS/px4fmu_common/init.d-posix/rcS.
#
# See px4-vision.env for external-vision / NatNet → MAVROS fusion tuning.
